+ * module costs no columns at the tile edges. Its colour space mapping stage
+ * stays off. With MTK_DIP_PARAMS_BLOCK_FL_DISABLE the module is off (the
+ * default); an enabled block switches it on from that job on, like the other
+ * blocks with a module of their own.
